        (affineCoarseLinkZOn C (Relativistic3DHilbertScalarDefect.dyadicMesh a₀ n) pos)
        (affineCubeLinks C (Relativistic3DHilbertScalarDefect.dyadicMesh a₀ n) p)‖ ≤
